<title>UK: John Lewis UK dept store sales up 10.9% last week.</title>
<headline>John Lewis UK dept store sales up 10.9% last week.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The John Lewis Partnership said on Friday its UK department store sales rose 10.9 percent in the week to April 19 versus the same week last year. In the 12 weeks to April 19 sales were up 9.5 percent compared with the same period a year ago.</p>
<p>Total sales, including the Waitrose supermarket group, were up 8.9 percent in the week to April 19 and rose 7.0 percent over the 12 week period.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7715</p>
